Package: hvtiverse
Type: Package
Title: Install and Check the HVTI R Package Family
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-08-19
Authors@R: person("John", "Ehrlinger", email = "john.ehrlinger@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Installs, updates and reports on the Cleveland Clinic Heart and
    Vascular Institute CORR group's family of R packages in a single step.
    Members are resolved from public GitHub repositories with 'pak', so that
    releases held behind the CRAN queue stay available to the group. Provides
    a status table comparing installed against latest versions, and a
    diagnostic report for environment problems.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    cli,
    utils
Suggests:
    curl,
    knitr,
    pak,
    quarto,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0)
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/ehrlinger/hvtiverse, https://ehrlinger.github.io/hvtiverse/
BugReports: https://github.com/ehrlinger/hvtiverse/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
